.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
.Dd November 20, 2026
.Dt NOQTIS-TOKEN 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm noqtis-token
.Nd keys on a PKCS #11 token: list, make, sign, decapsulate
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm noqtis token
.Cm list
.Op Fl m Ar module
.Nm noqtis token
.Cm keys
.Op Fl m Ar module
.Op Fl -slot Ar n
.Op Fl -pin-fd Ar n | Fl -pin-env Ar name
.Nm noqtis token
.Cm keygen
.Fl a Ar alg
.Fl n Ar label
.Op Fl o Ar key.pub
.Op Fl -force
.Op Fl m Ar module
.Op Fl -slot Ar n
.Op Fl -pin-fd Ar n | Fl -pin-env Ar name
.Nm noqtis token
.Cm pub
.Fl n Ar label | Fl -id Ar hex
.Fl o Ar key.pub
.Op Fl -force
.Op Fl m Ar module
.Op Fl -slot Ar n
.Op Fl -pin-fd Ar n | Fl -pin-env Ar name
.Nm noqtis token
.Cm sign
.Fl n Ar label | Fl -id Ar hex
.Op Fl c Ar ctx
.Op Fl o Ar sig
.Op Fl -force
.Op Fl m Ar module
.Op Fl -slot Ar n
.Op Fl -pin-fd Ar n | Fl -pin-env Ar name
.Ar file
.Nm noqtis token
.Cm dec
.Fl n Ar label | Fl -id Ar hex
.Fl o Ar ss
.Op Fl -force
.Op Fl m Ar module
.Op Fl -slot Ar n
.Op Fl -pin-fd Ar n | Fl -pin-env Ar name
.Ar ct
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm noqtis token
works with private keys that stay on a token: a smart card, a hardware
security module, or a software token.
The token's maker ships a PKCS #11 module, a shared library;
.Fl m
gives its path, and the variable
.Ev NOQTIS_PKCS11
gives it when the option is absent.
The module is named by a path, with a folder in it: a bare name is
refused, since the system would search its own folders for it.
.Pp
The key types are those of PKCS #11 version 3.2, ML-DSA, SLH-DSA and
ML-KEM, and Ed25519.
.Bl -tag -width "keygen"
.It Cm list
Print the tokens present: slot, label, maker, model and serial number.
.It Cm keys
Print the private keys on the token that noqtis can use: algorithm, ID
and label.
A token shows its private keys only after the PIN.
.It Cm keygen
Make a key pair of
.Ar alg
on the token under
.Ar label ;
the private key is marked never to leave it.
.Fl o
writes the public key as a key file.
.It Cm pub
Write the public key of a key on the token as a key file, for
.Xr noqtis-verify 1 ,
.Xr noqtis-enc 1
and the other commands.
.It Cm sign
Sign
.Ar file
with a signature key on the token.
The signature is the one
.Xr noqtis-sign 1
writes, and
.Xr noqtis-verify 1
checks it, with the same context
.Pq Fl c .
It is written only when it verifies under the token's own public key.
.It Cm dec
Decapsulate the ciphertext
.Ar ct
of
.Xr noqtis-enc 1
with an ML-KEM key on the token, and write the shared secret to
.Ar ss
(owner-only).
The module must be of version 3.2.
.El
.Pp
A key is named by its label
.Pq Fl n
or by its ID in hexadecimal
.Pq Fl -id ;
exactly one key must answer.
.Fl -slot
names the token when more than one is present.
The PIN is read from the descriptor of
.Fl -pin-fd
or the variable of
.Fl -pin-env ,
never from the command line.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width NOQTIS_PKCS11
.It Ev NOQTIS_PKCS11
The path of the PKCS #11 module, when
.Fl m
is not given.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
0 on success; 2 on a usage or file error, a wrong PIN, and when the
token refuses.
The token's own reason is printed as the CKR number of the standard.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal
$ export NOQTIS_PKCS11=/usr/lib/softhsm/libsofthsm2.so
$ noqtis token list
$ noqtis token keygen -a ML-DSA-65 -n release -o release.pub \e
      --pin-env PIN
$ noqtis token sign -n release -o app.tar.sig --pin-env PIN app.tar
$ noqtis verify -p release.pub -s app.tar.sig app.tar
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr noqtis 1 ,
.Xr noqtis-dec 1 ,
.Xr noqtis-sign 1 ,
.Xr noqtis-verify 1 ,
.Xr nqp11open 3
.Sh STANDARDS
OASIS PKCS #11 Specification Version 3.2.
